~ start
Boss: I have a special assignment for you.
- Accept the assignment
	Boss: TBD Spreadsheet minesweeper description
	$> start_puzzle.emit("Minesweeper")
	Boss: I need you to do well, or your job is on the line!
- Reject the assignment
	Boss: You'll regret this! Pack your things and get out, you're fired!
	=> END
- Leave the conversation 
	=> END
=> END

~ lostmine
Boss: Not good enough! Maybe you'll perform better at your next job, but you're done here. Pack your desk and leave.
=> END

~ losttime
Boss: Not quick enough! Maybe you'll perform better at your next job, but you're done here. Pack your desk and leave.
=> END

~ won
Boss: Excellent work! Unfortunately, we are letting you go due to downsizing efforts. We sure will miss that can-do attitude!
=> END